sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ChatApp
    participant Storage
    participant MesaCompiler
    participant Pack
    participant Responder
    participant Gemini
    User->>ChatApp: POST /api/chat (message, user_id, conversation_id)
    ChatApp->>Storage: ensure_user / ensure_conversation
    ChatApp->>Storage: get_conversation_turns (previous turn)
    ChatApp->>MesaCompiler: compile(query, previous_turn)
    MesaCompiler->>Pack: load atoms + rules
    MesaCompiler->>ChatApp: mesa + prompt_mesa
    ChatApp->>Responder: build_prompt(prompt_mesa)
    Responder->>Gemini: generate_content(gemini-2.5-flash)
    Gemini->>Responder: answer text
    ChatApp->>Storage: save_turn(mesa, answer)
    ChatApp->>User: turn (turn_id, mesa, assistant_message)